(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Using it for 4 months now. It's been almost a year since it's launch and it is still a good buy. Decent cameras, cameras is not it's strength, in the same price range you get other phones for better cameras. Battery, fast charging, UI UX , Software, Display, build quality, performance are all really good. It is the best all rounder phone to buy under 25k. Highly recommend it. I was considering to buy 13R for 40k but I feel Nord 4 is better value for money.

